# Security headers for Cloudflare (Workers static assets read this file).
# vercel.json sets the same ones for the Vercel copy. Keep the two in step.
#
# frame-ancestors / X-Frame-Options: only ChalkBored itself may put its pages
#   in a frame (Requests in Notebook, the game viewer, Chalk TV, the
#   about:blank cloak). Other sites can't wrap it.
# nosniff: browsers don't guess file types.
# Referrer-Policy: other sites don't see which ChalkBored page you came from.
# Permissions-Policy: no page can ask for camera, mic, location, payments, USB.
# No full Content-Security-Policy for scripts: the games need inline code and
#   loaders from many places, and it would break them.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
